---

The code under this directory (algan/external_libraries/ground/) is a subset
of ground (https://github.com/lycantropos/ground) by Azat Ibrakov, taken from
version 9.0.0 -- the vendored algan/external_libraries/ground/__init__.py
still carries the literal line `__version__ = "9.0.0"` from that release --
with import paths rewritten to this vendored location. See
algan/external_libraries/readme.txt for why this subset is vendored rather
than depended upon directly.
